{"id":"40d41bb5aac76af5","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-craig-interpolation.md","title":"Craig Interpolation for GL","display":"thm-craig-interpolation — Craig Interpolation for GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-craig-interpolation","aliases":["89-thm-craig-interpolation"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-craig-interpolation — Craig Interpolation for GL","depends_on":["[[89-df-inseparable-pair]]","[[89-lem-inseparable-extension]]","[[89-lem-inseparable-box-witness]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-craig-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-craig-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-craig-interpolation — Craig Interpolation for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18a7d6d6f6148b37\" href=\"?note=18a7d6d6f6148b37\" title=\"89-df-inseparable-pair\">89-df-inseparable-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28ea14cb0d1e7474\" href=\"?note=28ea14cb0d1e7474\" title=\"89-lem-inseparable-extension\">89-lem-inseparable-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e46af049d0ea6278\" href=\"?note=e46af049d0ea6278\" title=\"89-lem-inseparable-box-witness\">89-lem-inseparable-box-witness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为实际字母集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}craig\\text{-}interpolation}\\vdash\n(A\\to C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[(A\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\land(B\\to C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(C)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}craig\\text{-}interpolation}\\vdash\n(A\\to C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[(A\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\land(B\\to C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(C)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 118–121；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>这是原书 Smoryński 证明。固定前两引理的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\">\\(W=\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRx\">\\(wRx\\)</span> 当且仅当每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box E\\in w\">\\(\\Box E\\in w\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box E,E\\in x\">\\(\\Box E,E\\in x\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 有至少一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 未有的盒子；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in V(p)\\iff p\\in w\">\\(w\\in V(p)\\iff p\\in w\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 有限；盒集合严格增加给非自反性，盒保持与内式传递给传递性。\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in X\">\\(D\\in X\\)</span> 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models D\\iff D\\in w\">\\(M,w\\models D\\iff D\\in w\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 属某一侧语言，其子式也在该侧，投影一致性与正负决定给底、字母及布尔步骤。正盒由关系定义；负盒用见证引理的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，扩展成极大 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>：它包含此前全部盒及内式、新盒 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box E\">\\(\\Box E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg E\">\\(\\neg E\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRx\">\\(wRx\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\not\\models E\">\\(x\\not\\models E\\)</span>。\n若无所需插值公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{A,\\neg C\\}\">\\(\\{A,\\neg C\\}\\)</span> 不可分离。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 不可能有一方全部字母包含于另一方，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 本身就是插值公式；故两侧投影分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{A\\}\">\\(\\{A\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\neg C\\}\">\\(\\{\\neg C\\}\\)</span>，分离恰会给一个插值公式。有限扩展给非空模型中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 同时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\neg C\">\\(A,\\neg C\\)</span>，由真值引理反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to C\">\\(A\\to C\\)</span>，违反 GL 可靠性。\n此为来源可追踪的数学证明，未宣称已经由证明助手检查。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-inseparable-pair","status":"resolved","id":"18a7d6d6f